  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Hello everyone and welcome to EnglishPod Happy New Year!",
      "trans": "你好，大家，新年快乐！",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.5600000000000005
    },
    {
      "text": "My name is Marco and I'm Erica.",
      "trans": "我的名字是玛莎，我叫埃里卡。",
      "start": 4.5600000000000005,
      "end": 6.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Happy New Year!",
      "trans": "新年快乐！",
      "start": 6.92,
      "end": 7.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Happy New Year Marco!",
      "trans": "祝新年快乐，马克！",
      "start": 7.92,
      "end": 9.72
    },
    {
      "text": "It's December 31st and we are on New Year's Eve.",
      "trans": "今天是12月31日，我们即将迎来新年。",
      "start": 9.72,
      "end": 13.120000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "That's right and since it's New Year's Eve we're talking about New Year's resolutions.",
      "trans": "这个点和拍是傻瓜相机。SLR/DSLR是单反相机。机身是体，镜头是镜，长焦是长焦，偏振镜是偏振镜。卸下重任是卸下任务。赋予神速是授予神速。远程且微弱是疏远且微弱。步骤下来是卸任。辞职信是辞职信。入门级是入门级。显示屏是显示屏。套机镜头是机，Fluency Builder是流利构建单元。全球视野是全视界。",
      "start": 13.120000000000001,
      "end": 19.36
    },
    {
      "text": "Right, in many places it's very common to make a promise for the New Year, something",
      "trans": "正确。",
      "start": 19.36,
      "end": 24.72
    },
    {
      "text": "that you will change.",
      "trans": "那你会改变吗？",
      "start": 24.72,
      "end": 25.72
    },
    {
      "text": "A promise to yourself.",
      "trans": "英语：承诺自己。",
      "start": 25.72,
      "end": 27.0
    },
    {
      "text": "To yourself.",
      "trans": "自己。",
      "start": 27.0,
      "end": 28.0
    },
    {
      "text": "To change something.",
      "trans": "要改变什么。",
      "start": 28.0,
      "end": 29.48
    },
    {
      "text": "That's what our dialogue is about today so why don't we take a look at our vocabulary",
      "trans": "英语：那我们的对话今天讲的是什么，所以为什么不让我们看看我们的话题词汇？",
      "start": 29.48,
      "end": 33.4
    },
    {
      "text": "preview for this lesson.",
      "trans": "预览这节课。",
      "start": 33.4,
      "end": 36.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Vocabulary preview.",
      "trans": "词汇预览。",
      "start": 36.4,
      "end": 38.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay on vocabulary preview today we only have one word.",
      "trans": "今天词汇预览中，我们只有一句话。",
      "start": 38.4,
      "end": 41.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Eating habits.",
      "trans": "饮食习惯",
      "start": 41.96,
