    {
      "text": "Eating habits.",
      "trans": "饮食习惯。",
      "start": 44.24,
      "end": 45.519999999999996
    },
    {
      "text": "So what are eating habits?",
      "trans": "英语：所以吃什么？",
      "start": 45.519999999999996,
      "end": 47.2
    },
    {
      "text": "The regular way you eat.",
      "trans": "英语：你吃饭的常规方式是什么？",
      "start": 47.2,
      "end": 49.480000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "trans": "正确。",
      "start": 49.480000000000004,
      "end": 50.480000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "So if you eat healthy or if you eat lots of unhealthy food or even maybe what time you",
      "trans": "所以，如果你吃健康的食物或者吃大量的不健康的食品甚至可能是你什么时候开始的。",
      "start": 50.480000000000004,
