      "end": 60.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 60.24,
      "end": 61.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Eating habits.",
      "trans": "饮食习惯。",
      "start": 61.24,
      "end": 62.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 62.24,
      "end": 63.24
    },
    {
      "text": "So we're ready to listen to our dialogue today and it's going to be a little bit fast",
      "trans": "所以今天我们要准备听取今天的对话，可能会有点快。",
      "start": 63.24,
      "end": 67.44
    },
    {
      "text": "but don't worry about it.",
      "trans": "但是别担心。",
      "start": 67.44,
      "end": 68.88
    },
    {
      "text": "We'll come back and explain all of the key vocabulary after.",
      "trans": "我们将在返回后详细解释所有关键词汇。",
      "start": 68.88,
      "end": 80.28
    },
    {
      "text": "So did I tell you about my New Year's resolution?",
      "trans": "所以，你还是告诉我你的新年决心吧。",
      "start": 80.28,
      "end": 84.48
    },
    {
      "text": "I've decided to go on a diet.",
      "trans": "我决定减肥。",
      "start": 84.48,
      "end": 87.48
    },
    {
      "text": "And you're going to completely transform your eating habits right?",
      "trans": "您会彻底改变您的饮食习惯吗？",
      "start": 87.48,
      "end": 91.80000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "trans": "正确翻译为中文是：“正好。”",
      "start": 91.80000000000001,
      "end": 92.80000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm going to cut out all the junk I eat.",
      "trans": "我将彻底清除我吃过的所有垃圾。",
      "start": 92.80000000000001,
      "end": 96.08
