      "start": 101.16,
      "end": 102.16
    },
    {
      "text": "I've heard this one before.",
      "trans": "我听说过这个。",
      "start": 102.16,
      "end": 104.32000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "But this time I'm going to stick to it.",
