      "start": 110.36,
      "end": 113.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, I guess we'll just have to wait and see.",
      "trans": "英语：嗯，我猜我们得先看看。",
      "start": 113.92,
      "end": 124.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks honey.",
      "trans": "谢谢宝贝。",
      "start": 124.48,
      "end": 125.64
    },
    {
      "text": "That was a great meal.",
      "trans": "那是一顿美味的餐。",
      "start": 125.64,
      "end": 127.24000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm stuffed.",
