      "start": 319.56,
      "end": 323.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Stick to it.",
      "trans": "粘着住。",
      "start": 323.24,
      "end": 324.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Stick to it.",
      "trans": "粘着住。",
      "start": 324.56,
      "end": 325.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, we've got some examples of how this phrase is used.",
      "trans": "是的，我们已经举了一些例子来说明这个短语是如何使用的。",
      "start": 325.56,
      "end": 329.84000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "So let's listen.",
      "trans": "所以，让我们听。",
      "start": 329.84000000000003,
      "end": 332.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Example 1.",
      "trans": "示例 1。",
      "start": 332.04,
      "end": 334.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Ah, quitting smoking is so hard.",
      "trans": "英语：啊，戒烟这么难。",
      "start": 334.48,
      "end": 341.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Stick to it.",
      "trans": "粘着住。",
      "start": 341.68,
      "end": 342.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Good for you.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 342.68,
      "end": 347.84000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "Example 2.",
      "trans": "Example 2. (注释：请将此翻译内容复制粘贴到聊天框中，以便我能够进行中文转文字的功能。)",
      "start": 347.84000000000003,
      "end": 352.56
    },
    {
      "text": "I can't solve this math problem.",
      "trans": "我无法解决这个数学问题。",
      "start": 352.56,
      "end": 355.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Stick to it.",
      "trans": "粘着住。",
      "start": 355.0,
      "end": 356.0
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm sure you'll get it.",
      "trans": "我保证你会的。",
      "start": 356.0,
      "end": 360.6
    },
    {
      "text": "So stick to it, right?",
      "trans": "所以，坚持到底，对吗？",
      "start": 360.6,
      "end": 362.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Basically means keep doing it.",
      "trans": "基本意思就是继续做。",
      "start": 362.72,
      "end": 365.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Even though English learning can be hard, you should stick to it.",
      "trans": "虽然学习英语可能会很困难，但你应该坚持下去。",
      "start": 365.32,
      "end": 369.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Stick to it.",
      "trans": "坚持到底。",
      "start": 369.0,
      "end": 370.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 370.0,
      "end": 371.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "trans": "正确翻译为中文是：“正好。”",
      "start": 371.0,
      "end": 372.0
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean it.",
      "trans": "我指的是。",
      "start": 372.0,
      "end": 373.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Mean it.",
      "trans": "意味着。",
      "start": 373.0,
      "end": 374.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Mean it.",
      "trans": "英语：Mean it.",
      "start": 374.0,
      "end": 375.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, this is a great way of saying.",
      "trans": "很好，这是说一种好方法。",
      "start": 375.0,
      "end": 377.0
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm serious.",
      "trans": "我非常严肃。",
      "start": 377.0,
      "end": 378.0
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm serious.",
      "trans": "我非常认真。",
      "start": 378.0,
      "end": 379.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 379.0,
      "end": 380.0
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean it.",
      "trans": "我指的是。",
      "start": 380.0,
      "end": 381.0
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm not joking.",
      "trans": "我并不开玩笑。",
      "start": 381.0,
      "end": 382.0
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm not joking, right?",
      "trans": "英语：我可不是开玩笑的，对吗？",
      "start": 382.0,
      "end": 383.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 383.0,
      "end": 384.0
    },
    {
      "text": "And our final phrase in fluency builder.",
      "trans": "我们的最后一句话在流畅器中。",
      "start": 384.0,
      "end": 388.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut out.",
      "trans": "切开。",
      "start": 388.32,
      "end": 389.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut out.",
      "trans": "英语：切断。",
      "start": 389.32,
      "end": 390.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut out.",
      "trans": "切开。",
      "start": 390.32,
      "end": 391.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Again, we've got some examples of this phrase as native speakers use it.",
      "trans": "英语：再次，我们已经有一些例子来说明这个短语了。",
      "start": 391.32,
      "end": 396.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's listen.",
      "trans": "让我们听。",
      "start": 396.68,
      "end": 398.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Example 1.",
      "trans": "例 1.",
      "start": 398.48,
      "end": 399.48
    },
    {
      "text": "You have to cut out the salt from your diet.",
      "trans": "你必须从你的饮食中去除盐。",
      "start": 400.48,
      "end": 404.28000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "No more chips.",
      "trans": "无更多芯片。",
      "start": 404.28000000000003,
      "end": 405.36
    },
    {
      "text": "No more french fries.",
      "trans": "不许吃法国薯条。",
      "start": 405.36,
      "end": 406.84000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "No more popcorn.",
      "trans": "英语：没有更多的爆米花。",
      "start": 406.84000000000003,
      "end": 411.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Example 2.",
      "trans": "Example 2. (注释：请将此翻译内容复制粘贴到聊天框中，以便我进行中文翻译。)",
      "start": 411.56,
      "end": 415.52000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "It's time for me to focus on my work.",
      "trans": "英语：它的时间到了，我要专注于我的工作。",
      "start": 415.52000000000004,
      "end": 418.0
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm going to cut out everything else from my life.",
      "trans": "我将从我的生活中去除一切无关的东西。",
      "start": 418.0,
      "end": 421.96000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "OK, so cut out means to remove.",
      "trans": "好的，所以“cut out”意味着删除。",
      "start": 421.96000000000004,
      "end": 426.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Completely remove.",
      "trans": "完全卸下。",
      "start": 426.8,
      "end": 427.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Take it away.",
      "trans": "英语：拿走它。",
      "start": 427.8,
      "end": 428.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是啊。",
      "start": 428.8,
      "end": 429.8
    },
    {
      "text": "OK, some great language, some great phrases in our dialogue today.",
      "trans": "好的，今天的对话中有一些很棒的语言和我们今天讨论的话题。",
      "start": 429.8,
      "end": 433.76
    },
    {
      "text": "So why don't we listen to it a third time and we'll come back in a little bit.",
      "trans": "所以，我们为什么不再次听一下呢？然后我们会尽快回来的。",
      "start": 433.76,
      "end": 445.52
    },
    {
      "text": "So did I tell you about my new year's resolution?",
      "trans": "所以，我告诉你我的新一年的计划。",
      "start": 445.52,
      "end": 449.72
    },
    {
      "text": "I've decided to go on a diet.",
      "trans": "我决定减肥。",
      "start": 449.72,
      "end": 452.76
    },
    {
      "text": "And you're going to completely transform your eating habits, right?",
      "trans": "您将完全改变您的饮食习惯，对吗？",
      "start": 452.76,
      "end": 457.28000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "trans": "正确翻译为中文是：“正好。”",
      "start": 457.28000000000003,
      "end": 458.28000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm going to cut out all the junk I eat.",
      "trans": "我将彻底清理掉我吃过的所有垃圾。",
      "start": 458.28,
      "end": 461.35999999999996
    },
    {
      "text": "No more chips.",
      "trans": "无更多芯片。",
      "start": 461.35999999999996,
      "end": 462.91999999999996
    },
    {
      "text": "No more soda.",
      "trans": "无糖饮料。",
      "start": 462.91999999999996,
      "end": 464.44
    },
    {
      "text": "No more fried food.",
      "trans": "无油食品。",
      "start": 464.44,
      "end": 466.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Uh-huh.",
      "trans": "英语：嗯，对。",
      "start": 466.44,
      "end": 467.44
    },
    {
      "text": "I've heard this one before.",
      "trans": "我听说过这个。",
      "start": 467.44,
      "end": 469.59999999999997
    },
    {
      "text": "But this time, I'm going to stick to it.",
      "trans": "但是这次，我将继续坚持。",
      "start": 469.59999999999997,
      "end": 472.32
    },
    {
      "text": "I really mean it.",
      "trans": "我确实明白。",
      "start": 472.32,
      "end": 474.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Trust me, Carol.",
      "trans": "英语：信任我，卡罗尔。",
      "start": 474.32,
      "end": 475.32
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm going to be a new man in one year's time.",
      "trans": "我将在一年内成为一名新男子。",
      "start": 475.32,
      "end": 479.23999999999995
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, I guess we'll just have to wait and see.",
      "trans": "英语：嗯，我猜我们得先看看。",
      "start": 479.23999999999995,
      "end": 481.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks, honey.",
      "trans": "谢谢，宝贝。",
      "start": 489.28,
      "end": 490.88
    },
    {
      "text": "That was a great meal.",
      "trans": "这个是一道翻译题，要求将给定的英文短语翻译成简化中文。根据提供的标准和规则，我需要确保翻译准确且符合原意。以下是经过调整后的答案：",
      "start": 490.88,
      "end": 492.59999999999997
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm stuffed.",
      "trans": "我被压得喘不过气来。",
      "start": 492.59999999999997,
      "end": 495.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Do we have any chips left?",
      "trans": "英语：我们还有哪些芯片？",
      "start": 495.96,
      "end": 497.84
    },
    {
      "text": "OK, so New Year's resolutions are really common and popular thing in North America.",
      "trans": "好的，新年目标在北美很常见和受欢迎。",
      "start": 504.96,
      "end": 509.96
    },
    {
      "text": "It's tradition to make a promise to yourself on New Year's and stick to it throughout",
      "trans": "英语：它是在新年的第一天做出承诺，并且一直坚持下去。",
      "start": 509.96,
      "end": 514.6
    },
    {
      "text": "the whole year.",
      "trans": "一年的整年。",
      "start": 514.6,
      "end": 515.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "trans": "正确。",
      "start": 515.6,
      "end": 516.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Funny thing is that very few people actually stick to their New Year's resolution.",
      "trans": "英语：有趣的是，很少有人真正坚持自己的新年决心。",
      "start": 516.6,
      "end": 521.8000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "That's true.",
      "trans": "这句话的中文翻译是：“这就是正确的。”",
      "start": 521.8000000000001,
      "end": 522.8000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "The most common ones are, I'm going to quit smoking.",
      "trans": "英语：最常见的有，我打算戒烟。",
      "start": 522.8000000000001,
      "end": 525.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah?",
      "trans": "是的？",
      "start": 525.44,
      "end": 526.44
    },
    {
      "text": "That never happens.",
      "trans": "这句话的中文翻译是：“那从来不会发生。”",
      "start": 526.44,
      "end": 527.44
    },
    {
      "text": "No.",
      "trans": "不。",
      "start": 527.44,
      "end": 528.44
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm going to go on a diet like this guy.",
      "trans": "我打算像这个家伙这样减肥。",
      "start": 528.44,
      "end": 531.48
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm going to quit drinking.",
      "trans": "我将要停止饮酒。",
      "start": 531.48,
      "end": 533.84
    },
    {
      "text": "That almost never happens either.",
      "trans": "英语：那几乎总是不会发生的。",
      "start": 533.84,
      "end": 535.24
    },
    {
      "text": "On New Year's Eve, you start drinking.",
      "trans": "英语：在新年的晚上，你开始喝酒。",
      "start": 535.24,
      "end": 536.24
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean, it's a bad time.",
      "trans": "我指的是，这真是一个糟糕的时刻。",
      "start": 536.24,
      "end": 537.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Come on.",
      "trans": "英语：Come on.",
      "start": 537.64,
      "end": 539.32
    },
    {
      "text": "And another really common one is, I'm going to join a gym.",
      "trans": "另外，我也会加入健身房。",
      "start": 539.32,
      "end": 544.24
    },
    {
      "text": "That's why gym membership sales are so high in January.",
      "trans": "英语：那是因为1月的健身房会员销售很高。",
      "start": 544.24,
      "end": 548.5600000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "trans": "正确。以下是“right”在中文中的翻译：",
      "start": 548.5600000000001,
      "end": 549.5600000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Everyone joins a gym in January, but...",
      "trans": "英语：每个人都在1月参加健身房，但...",
      "start": 549.5600000000001,
      "end": 551.5600000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "February.",
      "trans": "二月。",
      "start": 551.5600000000001,
      "end": 552.5600000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "And very few people in the gym.",
      "trans": "和很少有人在健身房。",
      "start": 552.5600000000001,
      "end": 554.5600000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 554.5600000000001,
      "end": 555.5600000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "So, Marco, do you have a New Year's resolution for this year?",
      "trans": "英语：所以，马科，你今年的新年愿望是什么？",
      "start": 555.5600000000001,
      "end": 557.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 557.72,
      "end": 558.72
    },
    {
      "text": "I have a New Year's resolution, and I resolve to continue bringing everyone some great lessons.",
      "trans": "英语：我有一个新年决心，决心继续把大家带进一些好教训。",
      "start": 558.72,
      "end": 565.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh.",
      "trans": "哦。",
      "start": 565.2,
      "end": 566.2
    },
    {
      "text": "That's so good.",
      "trans": "这句话的中文翻译是：“那真是太好了。”",
      "start": 566.2,
      "end": 567.5600000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "And I think I can stick to that one.",
      "trans": "我猜我会坚持这个。",
      "start": 567.5600000000001,
      "end": 568.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 568.92,
      "end": 569.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, I do hope that you do stick to that one, Marco.",
      "trans": "英语：嗯，我希望你还是坚持那个，马科。",
      "start": 569.92,
      "end": 572.08
    },
    {
      "text": "We will.",
      "trans": "我们。",
      "start": 572.08,
      "end": 573.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Today, we're out of time, so please go to our website and leave all your questions and",
      "trans": "今天，我们已经到了时间了，请您去我们的网站上留言，并将所有您的问题和疑问留下。",
      "start": 573.08,
      "end": 577.4000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "comments at EnglishPod.com.",
      "trans": "评论在英语播客网站上。",
      "start": 577.4000000000001,
      "end": 580.36
    },
    {
      "text": "And we'll see you there.",
      "trans": "我们将在这里见你。",
      "start": 580.36,
      "end": 581.5600000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "But until then, it's...",
      "trans": "但是直到那时，它还是...。",
      "start": 581.5600000000001,
      "end": 582.5600000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Goodbye.",
      "trans": "再见。",
      "start": 582.5600000000001,
      "end": 583.5600000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Bye.",
      "trans": "再见。",
